title Home Assistant: locks and garage covers ask first: "Unlock Front door?" Yes / Cancel, then Unlocked; the garage door's Open / Close page, Open asks too
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 900
key down
key down
key down
wait 300
key enter
wait 400
shot confirm-lock
check confirm-lock
expect text "Unlock Front door?"
expect text "Yes"
expect text "Cancel"
key enter
wait 800
expect text "Unlocked"
shot unlocked
check unlocked
key down
key enter
wait 600
shot garage-page
check garage-page
expect text "Open"
expect text "Close"
key enter
wait 400
expect text "Open Garage door?"
shot confirm-garage
check confirm-garage
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Open Garage door?"
key esc
wait 300
expect text "FAVOURITES"
expect noquit
